{
  "name": "rust-sdl2",
  "description": "rust-sdl2 implements idiomatic Rust bindings for the SDL2 multimedia library, providing a high-level abstraction over cross-platform hardware interfaces for graphics, audio, and input devices. It employs RAII patterns to manage the lifecycle of low-level C resources, effectively mitigating manual memory management risks inherent in FFI. The library covers core SDL2 functionality including event loops, windowing, and hardware-accelerated 2D rendering through a modular architecture.",
